          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pezahia mwana wa Meshezabeli, uwaali wi inyumba ya Zera kandi wi ihiiri yi Ivuyuda, yasingira muvugono vwa vandu va Isiraeli mu viina viu mwami:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Avandu mu madaala gandi amanene na makekeeke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu vanyingi vamenya mu madaala makekeeke ahimbi ni milimi jiavo. Yavo avaari vi ihiiri ya Yuda vamenya mu madaala ga Kiriazi Ariba, Diboni, na Jekabizeeli, kandi na madaala gandi makekeeke agali ahimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi vamenya mu madaala manene ga Jeshua, Molada, Bezifete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hazarishuali, Beerisheba kandi madaala makekeeke ga likumberiza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi vamenya mu madaala manene ga Zikilaga, Mekona na madaala galio makekeeke, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enirimoni, Zora, Yaramuzi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zanoa, Adulamu, Lakishi, na Azeka kandi na madaala galio makekeeke. Avandu yava vamenya mu kivala hagati ha Beerisheba mu lovega lwa Isavaalu nu mulivona lia Hinomu mu lovega lwa Ivaale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
